#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House4/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House4_Text_BringsWorldCloserTogether"
msgid ""
"By being together with POKéMON,\n"
"people make more and more friends.\p"
"And that brings the world closer\n"
"together. I think it's wonderful!$"
msgstr ""
"和宝可梦在一起，\n"
"人们就会结交越来越多的朋友。\p"
"这样一来，世界也会变得更紧密。\n"
"我觉得这真是太好了！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House4/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House4_Text_GoBirdPokemon"
msgid ""
"There!\n"
"Go, BIRD POKéMON!$"
msgstr "好了！去吧，鸟宝可梦！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House4/scripts.inc:75
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House4_Text_AskedWingullToRunErrand"
msgid ""
"Heheh, I asked my WINGULL to run\n"
"an errand for me.$"
msgstr "嘿嘿，我让我的长翅鸥帮我跑腿去了。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House4/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House4_Text_WelcomeWingullTakeMentalHerb"
msgid ""
"Good!\n"
"Welcome back, WINGULL!\p"
"Huh? What is this?\n"
"What is it holding?\p"
"A MENTAL HERB?\n"
"It must have picked it up somewhere.\p"
"But I'm not a TRAINER, so you can\n"
"have it.$"
msgstr ""
"好！欢迎回来，长翅鸥！\p"
"咦？这是什么？它带着什么东西？\p"
"心灵香草？一定是它在哪里捡到的。\p"
"不过我又不是训练家，就送给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House4/scripts.inc:89
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House4_Text_FriendsFarAwayThanksToWingull"
msgid ""
"Thanks to my WINGULL, I have friends\n"
"who live far away.$"
msgstr ""
"多亏了我的长翅鸥，\n"
"我才有了住在远方的朋友。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House4/scripts.inc:93
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House4_Text_Wingull"
msgid "WINGULL: Pihyoh!$"
msgstr "长翅鸥：咻哟！$"
